## 10. EVOLUTION_LOG Format

Every write-back to `.ai/` files must include:

```text
📂 EVOLUTION_LOG
[时间] YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MMZ
[触发] Task {ID} 测试通过 | 设计偏离 | 用户指令
[变更] .ai/{file}: {description}
[建议] {recommended git command or follow-up action}
